{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o016b","title":"四帝神主至洛阳奉安宗庙","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o016b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"四帝神主至洛阳奉安宗庙","evidence":["mingdi-e-o016b-q"]},{"id":"mingdi-a-p014-analysis","label":"裴注·裴松之按","text":"裴松之说明所迎神主与魏初四室庙制，并指出至景初元年始定七庙。","evidence":["mingdi-q-p014-analysis"]},{"id":"mingdi-a-p015-judgment","label":"裴注·孙盛曰","text":"孙盛认为迎迁神主合乎事亡如存之礼。","evidence":["mingdi-q-p015-judgment"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":229,"label":"十二月己丑","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y229","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o013","basis":"十二月己丑"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o016b-q","mingdi-q-o013","mingdi-q-b-603b9eca40bc72aa5ca9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o016b-q","source_order":[3,91,"O016b"],"order":768}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o016b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7813ae24084c75e21fe4","layer":"original","quote":"初，洛阳宗庙未成，神主在邺庙。十一月，庙始成。使太常韩暨持节迎高皇帝、太皇帝、武帝、文帝神主于邺〖26〗。十二月，己丑至〖27〗，奉安神主于庙〖28〗。﹝一﹞癸卯〖29〗，大月氏王波调遣使奉献〖30〗，以调为亲魏大月氏王。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-603b9eca40bc72aa5ca9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-603b9eca40bc72aa5ca9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：太和三年（公元 229）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-04d89584b18b3bb50af5","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-o013","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c7981dd3e3485c76d7c8","layer":"original","quote":"三年夏四月〖1〗，元城王礼薨。六月，癸卯〖2〗，繁阳王穆薨。戊申〖3〗，追尊高祖大长秋曰高皇帝，夫人吴氏曰高皇后。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"mingdi-q-p014-analysis","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-12b95468f927119072bb","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之按：黄初四年，“有司奏立二庙：太皇帝、大长秋与文帝之高祖共一庙；特立武帝庙，百世不毁”。今此无高祖神主，盖以亲尽毁也。此则魏初唯立亲庙，祀四室而已。至景初元年，始定七庙之制。","attribution":"裴注·裴松之按","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-37c6e74c89ba66eb8b9e","start":0,"end":93},{"id":"mingdi-q-p015-judgment","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-116d6a1f8f87048fea6d","layer":"pei","quote":"孙盛曰：“事亡犹存，祭如神在；迎迁神主，正斯宜矣。”","attribution":"裴注·孙盛曰","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-37c6e74c89ba66eb8b9e","start":0,"end":26}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
